 "note": "Only colleges with at least one record go to apply. Read with no record: Ohlone (403 on the homepage, a new refusal), Reedley (403, State Center as Fresno City and Madera), Sacramento City (404 on the homepage), Porterville (Pages show only menu links (President's Message), a 'VA Certifying Official' label with an email and no name, and no named administrators; no directory names captured.), Saddleback (Only menu links (Articulation, VETS) and an unnamed 'Registrar Email: jfeigert@saddleback.edu'; ASG President is a student; no named administrator in excerpts.). Held out as staff, not the office's lead: Palomar's three Veterans Services Specialists and San Bernardino Valley's veterans counselor. Rio Hondo prints Dr. Caroline Durdella twice (VP Academic Affairs and an Associate VP), so both rows stand. Emails are blank where the page obfuscates them (San Diego City, SDCCE).",
